[{"answer":"Hello, Easy Life Cleaning Services, Jacinta speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm looking for a cleaning service for my apartment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/3.mp3"},{"answer":"do you do domestic cleaning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's just a one-bedroom flat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have a basic cleaning package?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/8.mp3"},{"answer":"For a one-bedroom flat we're probably looking at about two hours for a clean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So we'd do a thorough clean of all surfaces in each room,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and polish them where necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Does your apartment have carpets?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/12.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I don't have any, but the floor would need cleaning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, we'd do that in every room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/14.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'd do a thorough clean of the kitchen and bathroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/15.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we have some additional services which you can request if you want,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/17.mp3"},{"answer":"so for example, we can clean your oven for you every week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I hardly ever use that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but can you do the fridge?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like that done every week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And would ironing clothes be an additional service you can do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It wouldn't be much, just my shirts for work that week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/26.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And we could also clean your microwave if you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/28.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I wipe that out pretty regularly so there's no need for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/29.mp3"},{"answer":"We also offer additional services that you might want a bit less often, say every month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/30.mp3"},{"answer":"So for example, if the inside of your windows need cleaning, we could do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that'd be good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm on the fifteenth floor, so the outside gets done regularly by specialists,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/33.mp3"},{"answer":"but the inside does get a bit grubby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/34.mp3"},{"answer":"And we could arrange for your curtains to get cleaned if necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/35.mp3"},{"answer":"No, they're OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/36.mp3"},{"answer":"But would you be able to do something about the balcony?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite small and I don't use it much,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but it could do with a wash every month or so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/39-2023-06-30-21-49-48.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we can get the pressure washer onto that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Now if you're interested,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/41.mp3"},{"answer":"we do offer some other possibilities to do with general maintenance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/42.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, if you have a problem with water and you need a plumber in a hurry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/43.mp3"},{"answer":"we can put you in touch with a reliable one who can come out straightaway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/44.mp3"},{"answer":"And the same thing if you need an electrician.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. That's good to know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I've only just moved here so I don't have any of those sorts of contacts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/47.mp3"},{"answer":"And I don't know if this is of interest to you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/48.mp3"},{"answer":"but we also offer a special vacuum cleaning system","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/49.mp3"},{"answer":"which can improve the indoor air quality of your home by capturing up to 99% of all the dust in the air.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So if you're troubled by allergies, this can make a big difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. In fact, I don't have that sort of problem, but I'll bear it in mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Now can you tell me a bit about your cleaning staff?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/54.mp3"},{"answer":"So all our cleaners are very carefully selected.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/55.mp3"},{"answer":"When they apply to us, they have to undergo a security check with the police","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/56.mp3"},{"answer":"to make sure they don't have any sort of criminal background,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and, of course, they have to provide references as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Then if we think they might be suitable for the job, we give them training for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That lasts for two weeks so it's very thorough,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and at the end of it, they have a test.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/61.mp3"},{"answer":"If they pass that, we take them on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/62.mp3"},{"answer":"but we monitor them very carefully,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/63.mp3"},{"answer":"we ask all our clients to complete a review of their performance after every visit and to email it to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/64.mp3"},{"answer":"So we can pick up any problems straightaway and deal with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/65.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well that all sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And will I always have the same cleaner?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do our best to organise it that way, and we usually manage it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Good. That's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so I'd like to go ahead and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-1-2022-12-27-23-51-16/70.mp3"}]
